  "details": "HUD used to stay visible while in social/avatar/settings/worlds menus, but I think since the trust rank update it has been different. Unsure if it's a bug or intentional, either way I never thought it was in the way when using any menus, and it doesn't make sense to hide it when in those menus because if you have it enabled then you wouldn't think it was blocking things anyway.\n\nIt's a bit irritating since you can't see if your mic is muted or on, and if you've received invites/etc.. even though those aren't in a great state currently <_<",
